!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Processed data files contain the mean log2 fold-change of sgRNAs for each gene between the T1 time point (post-selection in vitro or xenograft tumor growth in vivo) and T0 time point (pre-selection).  Each column of data represents a replicate in ascending order (Rep1, Rep2, Rep3, etc).
!Sample_platform_id = GPL15520
